1.12.0
- Mastery of Binding: removes summon level cap entirely (was +1); Skeleton/Resurrection duration +10 turns.
- Wraith Summoning: explicitly tile-target with no corpse required.

1.11.0
- Summon Skeleton: Willpower tiers (Risen Recruit / Squire / Companion) with per-tier ally AI.
- Wraith Summoning: Willpower tiers (Wraith / Squire / Warrior / Commander).

1.10.0
- Bone Ward: shatter immediately on buff Destroy with center burst VFX + adjacent hit sparks/damage (deferred alarm helpers never fired).

1.9.0
- Corpse Burst / Black Sepulchre / Death Touch: call scr_damage_init on impact create so Animation End damage no longer crashes on unset damage fields.

1.8.0
- Death Touch / Black Sepulchre: replace nonexistent snd_arcane_impact_1 with vanilla impact sounds (fixes Animation End crash).

1.7.0
- Seal of Power (Magic Mastery): necromancy transform now grants +15% Magic Power, +2 Unholy Damage to strikes/shots, +2 Summon Damage, and +10% Summon Health.
- Summon enchant apply folds in Seal of Necromancy bonuses and refreshes on seal gain / servant turns.
- Register Unbind / Bound Servant buff names in table_effects for combat log.

1.6.0
- Seal of Power (Magic Mastery): necromancy transform now grants +15% Magic Power, +2 Unholy Damage to strikes/shots, +2 Summon Damage, and +10% Summon Health.
- Summon enchant apply folds in Seal of Necromancy bonuses and refreshes on seal gain / servant turns.

1.5.0
- Grave Blight: apply enemy Magic Resistance debuff on turn tick (was only in create-time Alarm_2 before zone coords existed); debuff lasts 1.5x area duration (6 turns).
- Summon Skeleton: consume nearby Bone by tile adjacency to summon tile or caster (was easy to miss).

1.4.0
- Summon Skeleton: if a Bone is nearby on cast, consume it for +10% Max Health and Armor Durability 10%.

1.2.0
- Raise tier 3/4 skill attribute gates and add level OR alternatives (16 / 22).
- Retarget Blooming Madness and Wraith Summoning prerequisites to Black Sepulchre.
- Grave Blight area now scales with Magic Power (3x3 up to 5x5), applies Blind, and shows gas on affected tiles.

1.1.0
- Add summon gear enchant system and apply bonuses to Skeleton, Resurrection, and Wraith summons.
- Fix enchant registration so bonuses apply reliably.

1.0.0
- Public release baseline for Stoneshard 0.9.4.25.
